<title>FINLAND: Rautaruukki 4-mth profit falls 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Rautaruukki 4-mth profit falls 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     285 vs 357</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.15 vs 2.76</p>
<p> Net sales					  4,344 vs 4,325</p>
<p> Operating profit				   397 vs 504</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 10 analysts' forecasts for Finnish steel group Rautaruuki Oy's profit before extras, tax had been 256 million markka in a 90-310 million range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					 257 vs 248</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 112 vs 147 charge</p>
<p> Profit before reserves, taxes		  285 vs 357</p>
<p> Reserves, taxes and minorities	 charge 28 vs 29 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					   257 vs 328</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    33.7 vs 30.5</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE) (percent)	    17.7 vs 24.7</p>
<p> Gearing						137 vs 157</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Rautaruukki Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
